# The Laravel API is not deployed to Vercel — it needs a persistent filesystem
# for uploaded documents and a MySQL server it can create per-tenant databases
# on, neither of which a serverless platform provides. It is hosted separately
# and reached over VITE_API_URL.
#
# Only applies to `vercel` CLI deploys. A Git-integration deploy clones the
# whole repo regardless; the build still only reads the Vite project at the
# root, so the API directory is inert either way.
orbit-hrms-api

# Not needed to build the SPA.
tests
vitest.config.js
